					<description><![CDATA[<h3>SK Series Pipeline Cartridge Filter</h3>
SK series pipeline filter is used as a pre-filter and is suitable for various applications. The equipment is designed according to the pressure vessel manufacturing specifications, durable and easy to install.]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h3>Product Features</h3>
<ul>
<li>Pre-filtration suitable for various applications.</li>
<li>Various standard inlet and outlet forms are available for easy installation on the piping system.</li>
<li>Mechanically polished perforated baskets make cleaning easier.</li>
<li>Filtration accuracy is as low as 25 microns.</li>
<li>The handle on the basket is convenient for installation and removal.</li>
<li>Design pressure from 6bar-21bar.</li>
<li>Filter materials are available in carbon steel, 304 stainless steel, 316 stainless steel and other specific materials.</li>
<li>Appropriate sealing rings can be provided according to chemical compatibility and temperature range.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Typical Applications</h3>
<ul>
<li>Food and beverage sterilisation filtration.</li>
<li>High-purity water terminal filtration.</li>
<li>Fine chemical product filtration.</li>
<li>Wine canning filtration.</li>
<li>Liquor\Wine canning filtration.</li>
<li>Electronics.</li>
<li>Petroleum, Automobile.</li>
<li>Pulp and Paper.</li>
<li>Pharmacy.</li>
</ul>
